<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { ChevronLeft, ChevronRight, Search, SlidersHorizontal } from 'lucide-vue-next'
import { dishes, photoPositions, villaPhotos } from '../data'
const categories = ['Tout', 'Entrées', 'Plats', 'Pizzas', 'Pâtes', 'Desserts', 'Boissons']
const activeCategory = ref('Tout')
const activeFilter = ref('Tout')
const query = ref('')
const currentPage = ref(1)
const pageSize = 12
const filteredDishes = computed(() => dishes.filter((dish) => (activeCategory.value === 'Tout' || dish.category === activeCategory.value) && (activeFilter.value === 'Tout' || dish.tags.includes(activeFilter.value)) && `${dish.name} ${dish.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.value.toLowerCase())))
const pageCount = computed(() => Math.ceil(filteredDishes.value.length / pageSize))
const paginatedDishes = computed(() => filteredDishes.value.slice((currentPage.value - 1) * pageSize, currentPage.value * pageSize))
watch([activeCategory, activeFilter, query], () => { currentPage.value = 1 })
</script>

<template><div><section class="page-hero page-hero-menu"><div class="page-hero-image" :style="{ backgroundImage: `url(${villaPhotos.interior})`, backgroundPosition: photoPositions[villaPhotos.interior] }"></div><div class="page-hero-shade"></div><div class="page-hero-content"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><i></i> LA CARTE OFFICIELLE</span><h1>La <em>carte</em></h1><p>Les spécialités de LA VILLA ZARZIS,<br>avec les prix affichés en dinars tunisiens.</p></div></section><section class="menu-page section-wrap"><div class="menu-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> RESTAURANT ITALIEN · ZARZIS</span><h2>À chacun son <em>Italie.</em></h2></div><p>Retrouve ici les boissons et desserts lisibles sur la carte officielle, ainsi que les rubriques du menu. Les photos montrent les produits et l’ambiance de La Villa.</p></div><div class="menu-controls"><div class="category-tabs"><button v-for="category in categories" :key="category" :class="{ selected: activeCategory === category }" @click="activeCategory = category">{{ category }}</button></div><div class="filter-row"><label class="search-box"><Search :size="16"/><input v-model="query" placeholder="Rechercher un produit..." aria-label="Rechercher un produit"></label><label class="select-box"><SlidersHorizontal :size="15"/><select v-model="activeFilter" aria-label="Filtrer les produits"><option>Tout</option><option>Chaud</option><option>Froid</option><option>Sans alcool</option><option>Avec alcool</option><option>Café</option></select></label></div></div><div v-if="filteredDishes.length" class="menu-grid"><article v-for="dish in paginatedDishes" :key="dish.name" class="menu-card"><div class="menu-card-photo"><img :src="dish.image" :style="{ objectPosition: dish.imagePosition || photoPositions[dish.image] }" :alt="dish.name"><div class="tag-list"><span v-for="tag in dish.tags" :key="tag" :class="['dish-tag', { 'tag-green': tag === 'Sans alcool', 'tag-gold': tag === 'Avec alcool' } ]">{{ tag }}</span></div></div><div class="menu-card-content"><div class="menu-card-title"><span class="dish-category">{{ dish.category }}</span><span class="dish-price">{{ dish.price }}</span></div><h3>{{ dish.name }}</h3><p>{{ dish.description }}</p></div></article></div><div v-else class="empty-state">Aucun produit ne correspond à votre recherche. Essaie une autre catégorie ou un autre filtre.</div><nav v-if="pageCount > 1" class="menu-pagination" aria-label="Pagination de la carte"><button type="button" class="pagination-arrow" :disabled="currentPage === 1" aria-label="Page précédente" @click="currentPage--"><ChevronLeft :size="16" /> Précédente</button><div class="pagination-pages"><button v-for="page in pageCount" :key="page" type="button" :class="{ selected: page === currentPage }" :aria-label="`Page ${page}`" :aria-current="page === currentPage ? 'page' : undefined" @click="currentPage = page">{{ page }}</button></div><span class="pagination-count">{{ (currentPage - 1) * pageSize + 1 }}–{{ Math.min(currentPage * pageSize, filteredDishes.length) }} sur {{ filteredDishes.length }}</span><button type="button" class="pagination-arrow" :disabled="currentPage === pageCount" aria-label="Page suivante" @click="currentPage++">Suivante <ChevronRight :size="16" /></button></nav><p class="menu-note">Les plats et prix détaillés de certaines rubriques (entrées, viandes, pizzas, pâtes) sont à confirmer sur une photo plus nette de la carte.</p></section></div></template>
